  "ingredients": [
    "2 ears corn, husked and cleaned",
    "2 yellow squash, diced",
    "0.5 cup water",
    "2 tablespoons butter, or more to taste",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh parsley",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pcXXvf_1l5u1KXpgODxz4ehCqEQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238370-yellow-squash-and-corn-saute-VAT-step-01-a07948b31f3a465a9580ede4a4100656.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238370/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place corn in a large pot; cover with salted water and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low; simmer until tender, 10 to 15 minutes. Drain; set aside to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cFI-qmtBtJjG2Jry0QzEAG0eL90=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238370-yellow-squash-and-corn-saute-VAT-step-02-b1ecd7b0ab284dd89c716826a83affa1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238370/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, place squash in a large skillet over medium heat; add ½ cup water. Cook until tender, 5 to 10 minutes. Drain any excess water from the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5K1h3cAKZqOr1Ufx6Y6Zj9lA8vg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238370-yellow-squash-and-corn-saute-VAT-step-03-0060f5cbad734f69bdf1c0ffd49e0bab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238370/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut kernels off cobs. Stir corn, butter, parsley, salt, and black pepper into squash; cook, stirring occasionally, until heated through, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
